## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 2.0 Flash
- **Short description:** Google’s Gemini 2.0 Flash was a 1M-context multimodal workhorse model for fast tasks; it is deprecated/shut down and retained here as a historical reference.
- **Provider / access:** Historical Google AI Studio / Vertex AI / Gemini API (`gemini-2.0-flash`). Local metadata lists `google/gemini-2.0-flash`, shutdown 2026-06-01, and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Gemini API docs reviewed 2026-11-10; model deprecated/shut down (June 1, 2026 per docs). Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed source.
- **IDs:** `gemini-2.0-flash`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 input tokens; 8,192 output tokens (Gemini API docs).
- **Modalities:** Audio, images, video, and text input; text output (Gemini API docs). Native tool use noted in local metadata.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10, historical):** Shut down. Local metadata cites historical Google AI Studio $0.10/$0.40 per 1M (audio in $0.70) and Vertex AI $0.15/$0.60.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Google model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

